2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1274%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E8%B6%85%E5%AF%BC%E9%87%91%E5%B1%9E%E6%B0%A2%22%2C%22count%22%3A220%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1140%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22count%22%3A18%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1890%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1668173374035\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"info\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--info obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h1>武器数据</h1> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__info-table\"><colgroup><col> <col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/11/11/50494840/c80b606029a5bc9d6eaf1b8d650f4de5_2451249258848002782.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">436</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">15</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">某个诞生于拟似时间晶体中的人工智能，运用超越现代的材料技术打造而成的泛用型中近距离武器。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">能够激发出制造者用以退敌的全方位多单元精准打击系统——「瞄捕者系统」的最大输出功率，释放绚丽的等离子焰。作为最终式样，其名称被赋予了代表制造者的标识。</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">瞄捕者-裂解式</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:0秒]武器主动技能的冷却时间、充能次数、技能效果由装备角色的类型决定</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">使用武器技能时，环刃武器进入【超频】模式，角色自身全伤害提高12.0%，持续20秒，重复触发刷新持续时间，期间武器技命中敌人时，在目标处释放【脉冲】对范围内敌人造成15.0%攻击力火焰元素伤害，冷却时间：0.5秒</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">源代码：时梦</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">全队全伤害提高12.0%（该效果唯一生效）。时帆旅人使用时，在【超频】模式下击回【Aimer-β】环刃单元会让武器进入特殊【超频】模式，对点燃敌人造成的火焰伤害提高20.0%，持续20秒</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">等离子火焰</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">自身火焰元素伤害提高15.0%，【脉冲】命中的敌人受到的火焰元素伤害提高8.0%，若目标处于被点燃状态则受到的火焰伤害提高至15.0%，持续15秒，重复触发刷新持续时间</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"forging\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--forging obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>悬赏锻造</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">超限素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1893/detail\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/10/31/50494840/58b8f1cece28695cdf722535a3144827_4022398404723949757.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">解锁「旅梦时舵」图鉴后任意环刃蛋池武器</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*1</span></div></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">其他素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-other-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1274/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">爱因斯坦环磁机</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*100</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1140/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">超导金属氢</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*5