22https%3A%2F%2Fuploadstatic.mihoyo.com%2Fbh3-wiki%2F2022%2F11%2F07%2F50494840%2F3b7d342c24b4bb0e4355e2d05296aa50_1287343809310445104.gif%22%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1667830714684\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"role\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--role obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>适用角色</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/11/07/50494840/e398c383448a837fe858711a942519df_6773085938370198684.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>时帆旅人</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">全方面提高输出和辅助能力，很好的契合了角色的技能机制，使加成有着不错的覆盖率。</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/11/07/50494840/54385f9c708c261352ca8823072f43f8_4735166059512848329.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>空梦 · 掠集之兽</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon obc-tmpl__rate-icon--inactive\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon obc-tmpl__rate-icon--inactive\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">提高面板和辅助能力，武器技触发条件简单，可享火易伤加成。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/11/07/50494840/3b7d342c24b4bb0e4355e2d05296aa50_1287343809310445104.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">无条件提升全队全伤和自身火伤；武器技命中敌人时，将造成范围火伤、提供火易伤和自身全伤，若目标被点燃火易伤效果将额外提高，具有一定的辅助能力。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">时帆旅人使用时，【Aimer-γ切割者】/【Aimer-Λ领域】可多次触发武器的技能效果，追加额外的攻击和连击手段；蓄力攻击并且击回环刃后将提高自身对点燃敌人造成的火伤。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/11/07/50494840/3b7d342c24b4bb0e4355e2d05296aa50_1287343809310445104.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
